msgctxt "32rBNK"
msgid "Terms of Service"
msgstr "Terms of Service"

#: app/sign-up/page.tsx
msgctxt "0vL5u1"
msgid "Create an account"
msgstr "Create an account"

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "iSjB38"
msgid "Deni Run is an AI teammate service that can operate a private computer (browser, files, and terminal) on your behalf. By creating an account you agree to these terms."
msgstr "Deni Run is an AI teammate service that can operate a private computer (browser, files, and terminal) on your behalf. By creating an account you agree to these terms."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "j9MGr2"
msgid "You are responsible for the tasks you assign, including browsing, file changes, and shell commands. Do not use Deni Run to break the law, attack systems, send spam, or process data you are not allowed to handle. Destructive actions may require your approval, but you remain responsible for the outcome."
msgstr "You are responsible for the tasks you assign, including browsing, file changes, and shell commands. Do not use Deni Run to break the law, attack systems, send spam, or process data you are not allowed to handle. Destructive actions may require your approval, but you remain responsible for the outcome."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "8BzMay"
msgid "You must not use Deni Run to create, edit, or distribute sexual or intimate imagery of a real person without their consent, including AI-generated imagery, or any sexual content involving minors. We remove such content and suspend and report the accounts involved."
msgstr "You must not use Deni Run to create, edit, or distribute sexual or intimate imagery of a real person without their consent, including AI-generated imagery, or any sexual content involving minors. We remove such content and suspend and report the accounts involved."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "F5hHF3"
msgid "Usage limits apply by plan. Paid subscriptions renew monthly until canceled through the billing portal. Fees are charged by Stripe. We may suspend accounts that abuse infrastructure, exceed fair use, or violate these terms."
msgstr "Usage limits apply by plan. Paid subscriptions renew monthly until canceled through the billing portal. Fees are charged by Stripe. We may suspend accounts that abuse infrastructure, exceed fair use, or violate these terms."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "BARVqC"
msgid "Computer sessions, files, and memory stay scoped to your account. You can export or delete that data from <link>Account</link>. Deleting your account also removes the login stored for this service."
msgstr "Computer sessions, files, and memory stay scoped to your account. You can export or delete that data from <link>Account</link>. Deleting your account also removes the login stored for this service."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "bXXNWc"
msgid "If you link a Discord account, you are responsible for who can use that account. Anyone who can send direct messages from it can use your workspace much as you can in the app, except account and billing settings: give your teammates tasks, approve actions with the Approve button, change teammates, groups, skills, routines, and plugins, and read or delete workspace files. Discord’s own terms and privacy policy apply to your use of Discord. You can unlink at any time from Plugins or with /unlink."
msgstr "If you link a Discord account, you are responsible for who can use that account. Anyone who can send direct messages from it can use your workspace much as you can in the app, except account and billing settings: give your teammates tasks, approve actions with the Approve button, change teammates, groups, skills, routines, and plugins, and read or delete workspace files. Discord’s own terms and privacy policy apply to your use of Discord. You can unlink at any time from Plugins or with /unlink."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "PR34Xj"
msgid "Our <link>Privacy Policy</link> explains how we handle your data, including information received from Google sign-in."
msgstr "Our <link>Privacy Policy</link> explains how we handle your data, including information received from Google sign-in."

#: app/terms/page.tsx
msgctxt "fyPFTO"
msgid "The service is provided as-is. We do not warrant uninterrupted availability. These terms may be updated as the product changes."
msgstr "The service is provided as-is. We do not warrant uninterrupted availability. These terms may be updated as the product changes."

